[17.731, "o", "Top matches:\r\n\r\n**SQL optimization**\r\n- `bigquery-guidelines` skill \u2014 SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering, window functions, schema design (tier 0, no auth)\r\n- `database-design` skill \u2014 Cloud SQL/AlloyDB/Spanner schema, indexing, connection pooling (tier 0)\r\n- `mcp:bigquery` \u2014 dry-runs + cost estimation on live data (tier 3, needs GCP auth)\r\n\r\n**Zero-trust security**\r\n- `well-architected-security` skill \u2014 zero-trust patterns, IAM least-privilege audit, network perimeters, encryption (tier 0)\r\n- `gcp-auth-recipes` skill \u2014 ADC, Workload Identity Federation, service account impersonation (tier 0)\r\n- `gke-architecture` skill \u2014 network policies/hardening if you're on Kubernetes (tier 0)\r\n\r\nAll the best-practice skills are `tier:0` (no auth, ready now). Want me to pull up the full contents of either skill (e.g., `well-architected-security` or `bigquery-guidelines`) so you can apply them directly?\r\n"]
