[79.572, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_auth_status Unknown\r\n"]
[82.072, "o", "Authentication status: `gcloud_unauthenticated`. No active Service Account, User ADC, or API keys found.\r\n\r\nYou can't be fully logged in from here (it needs a browser flow), so please run this in your terminal:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngcloud auth application-default login\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis opens a browser to authenticate your Google account and stores ADC credentials so GCP tools (BigQuery, Vertex AI, etc.) can call APIs on your behalf.\r\n\r\nAfter that, tell me which service you'd like to use and I'll wire it up.\r\n"]
