[103.204, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"run SQL query against BigQuery public dataset usa_names usa_1910_current\"}\r\n"]
[105.704, "o", "Running this query requires the BigQuery MCP server, which needs GCP credentials. Your environment is currently unauthenticated (no service account, no ADC).\r\n\r\nThe query I'd run is:\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nSELECT name, SUM(number) AS total\r\nFROM `bigquery-public-data.usa_names.usa_1910_current`\r\nWHERE year = 2020\r\nGROUP BY name\r\nORDER BY total DESC\r\nLIMIT 5;\r\n```\r\n\r\nWant me to proceed? If so, I need you to confirm you'd like to use Google BigQuery, then authenticate on your terminal.\r\n"]
[106.753, "o", "\u001b[?2004hdeveloper@workstation:~/ard-project$ "]
[109.253, "o", "."]
[109.283, "o", "/"]
